# Dependencies & logs
node_modules/
*.log

# Generated eval outputs & reports.
#
# ROOT ONLY. A bare `*.html` also caught web/index.html — Vite's entry point, and the one
# file without which `npm run web` cannot start — so the browser dashboard did not build on
# a clean clone while every other file under web/ was tracked. Reports are written here, at
# the top level; source HTML lives in an app directory and is not this pattern's business.
eval/
/*.html
shock_eval.txt

